      "Added missing schema-declared alias groups for card expiration, CVV/CID/CVC, cardholder, routing number, account type, current balance, message identifiers, end-to-end identifiers, payment/order/payment-intent/customer identifiers, customer contact fields, ISO8583 fields, and UPI fields.",
      "Removed obsolete negative interpretation of account_type::type by placing type/subtype in account_type alias group.",
      "Separated generic/payer/customer VPA from payee_vpa for role safety.",
      "Added provider-qualified aliases for v17.0.0 compatibility while preserving conceptual alias groups for paper evaluation."
    ],
    "policy": "True aliases represent schema-declared same-canonical semantic fields and safe conceptual aliases. Negative pairs represent role-changing, identifier-subtype-changing, card-vs-bank account, payer-vs-payee, amount-vs-balance/status/method/temporal, and unsafe partition-changing merges.",
